  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Armauer Hansen Research Institutes research and training activities strengthened
- New and improved sustainable approaches for research and training developed
-Investigations into epidemiology, zoonotic importance and economic impact of new disease areas carried out, contributing to meet MDG targets in health
-Best practices in research and training established and maintained
-Partner and donor coordination strategy strengthened and expanded</narrative>
